cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OrgMemBench, please cite it as below."
title: "OrgMemBench: A Benchmark for Long-Horizon Organizational Memory in AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  A synthetic, multi-author, multi-channel, bi-temporal benchmark for long-horizon organizational
  memory in AI agents, with deterministic ground truth projected from a known source-of-truth graph,
  a uniform evaluation harness over publicly available memory systems, and small and medium tiers.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gardner
    given-names: Jack
year: 2026
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/JackCGardner/OrgMemBench"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JackCGardner/OrgMemBench"
keywords:
  - organizational memory
  - long-horizon memory benchmark
  - bi-temporal knowledge graph
  - AI agent memory
  - temporal reasoning evaluation
